# {{display_name}}

This project is a standalone RusToK module component with slug `{{slug}}`.
It uses the canonical generated guest SDK and receives platform access only
through declared brokered capabilities.

## Authoring

1. Update `module-artifact.json` and its bundled JSON Schemas together.
2. Keep `module-build-policy.toml` fail-closed.
3. Generate `Cargo.lock` with the pinned toolchain before validation.
4. Run `cargo test --locked` for host-side tests.
5. Build the component with
   `cargo build --locked --release --target {{component_target}}`.

The build worker derives `module-artifact-descriptor.json` after it verifies
the Component payload. Source code must never create that final descriptor or
declare `artifact_digest`.
